ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Ukiyo-e
Board: /styles/ukiyo-e
Companions: ukiyo-e-starter.html, ukiyo-e-study.ai, ukiyo-e-study.psd

Document
2400 × 3600 px. Paper fill #f4efe2. No transparency.

Layer stack, top to bottom — each color is its own block
- Keyline, 100% black #161616, even weight
- Red shape #c83b2f
- Blue shape #123a78
- Green shape #2f6b4f
- Paper

One color layer is nudged 3 px off the key. Do not add shading, texture overlays, or a scanned print underneath.
